  "id": "the-magnus-archives",
  "title": "The Magnus Archives",
  "subtitle": "A weekly horror fiction podcast featuring short stories, serial plots, full soundscapes, guest actors and more.",
  "description": "The Magnus Archives is a weekly horror fiction anthology podcast examining what lurks in the archives of the Magnus Institute, an organisation dedicated to researching the esoteric and the weird. Join new head archivist Jonathan Sims as he attempts to bring a seemingly neglected collection of supernatural statements up to date, converting them to audio and supplementing them with follow-up work from his small but dedicated team. Individually, they are unsettling. Together they begin to form a picture that is truly horrifying because as they look into the depths of the archives, something starts to look back…",
